Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没叫醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道你整晚没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I knew you were up all night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在用手电筒看漫画\N{\fnArial\fs30}reading comics with a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维奥莉特怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with Violet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  我告诉过你别给它们取名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, I told you not to name them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不再是小猪了  而是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not piglets anymore. They're food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得  直到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought, you know, until...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:03:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能生病了  也可能没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be sick, could be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早日康复  维奥莉特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel better, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走  我们去忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  S医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Dr. S?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-早上好  达里尔  -早上好  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Daryl. - Morning, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻起来挺香的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住啊  是我先喜欢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, I liked you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克也带了很多人回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Rick brought in a lot of them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,庇护陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the stranger sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他们吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping people fed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得学会宽容的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to learn to live with the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你去看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里克  你能来接手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick, you want to take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Dixon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想感谢你昨天带回了那头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to thank you for bringing that deer back yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真是大饱口福  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a real treat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能和你握手  我将倍感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd be honored to shake your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天  \N{\fnArial\fs30}About today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道我们这边能否分出人进城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if we're gonna be able to spare a lot of people for the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个地方已经清空了  我们会继续推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place is good to go. We're gonna move on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  一夜之间行尸暴增\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, we had a pretty big buildup overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三号塔那边更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dozens more towards tower three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况和上个月一样糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting as bad as last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不再分散了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't spread out anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人越多  就会吸引越多的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}With more of us sitting here, we're drawing more of them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get enough of those
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴在围栏边  然后越聚越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}damn fence-clingers, they start to herd up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来推围墙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pushing against the fences again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还撑得住  但得尽快行动  不然坚持不久 \N{\fnArial\fs30}It's manageable, but unless we get ahead of it, not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要辛苦你了  宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Pookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你今天还是别去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you should go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有防爆服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不用去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you don't have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道一切都会好的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know everything's gonna work out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得留下  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're staying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去穿个围裙  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need an apron. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算今天跟他们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of going on the run today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢隔着围栏爆它们的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like killing them on the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌的很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而在外面  它们向着你走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, when they're coming at you out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想都不用想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当它们层层趴在围栏上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they're stacked up against the chain-link,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对面  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just face-to-face. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想做点别的来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to do something different to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你总是自告奋勇来做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always volunteered to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你总是在做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you were always doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想多点机会了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just thought I could get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just gonna come find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找我什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委员会把大家从煤炭小队撤回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the council pulled back everyone on the coal crew
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备组织外出\N{\fnArial\fs30}from going on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在缺人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're shorthanded right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得应该加入他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured I'd step up to help, go with 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想在走之前见你一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, you know, wanted to make sure that I saw you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是... 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just-- 'cause, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's dangerous going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那不跟我道别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, are you gonna say good-bye?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整的跟言情小说似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a damn romance novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to start pulling my weight around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃  这才过了一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, it's only been a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一周我能吃上饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a week worth of meals,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个安身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}a roof over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我也发光发热好继续待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me earn my keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔找到你时  你孤身一人  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were out on your own when Daryl found you. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道  你会团队作战吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to make sure you know how to play on a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果很困难  我们也不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't gonna do it unless it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是军医\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he was a medic in the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是难搞定  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a hell of a tough sell. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些叶子都会长在背阳处\N{\fnArial\fs30}These leaves are gonna be in the shade,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此长不出什么好果子\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we won't get any good fruit from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们就把它从这里掐断\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just pinch it off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根茎断了  但它们还能生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things break, but they can still grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些小枝  它们会扎根\N{\fnArial\fs30}These little bristles, they'll take root
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就会有棵全新的植物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll have a whole new plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你我们真开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你们我也很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人中头彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看完了轮我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to read 'em when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脸上一片狼藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face is losing the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.84,0:10:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要待一段时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna stay a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴看到你安全归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我寻思着要在梅肯附近找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking of looking over near Macon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七十里路满是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}70 miles of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有可能碰上几个不太友好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might run into a few unneighborly types.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check out the Big Spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前说过的那个  就去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one I was talking about, just seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我得出去检查一下陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got to go out and check the snares.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想把我们抓到的东西白白让给行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to lose whatever we catch to the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚到这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要去检查陷阱  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Going to check the snares? - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能去  去做你的杂事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not. Do your chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你的漫画  或者读几本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read comics. Maybe some books, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找帕特里克玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang out with Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许去参加故事会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe go to story time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸  那是小孩干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, that's for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  刷刷她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now brush her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在这里没什么不对的  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with staying close, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为我们种了足够的庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're growing us enough food
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近期内你不用再四处奔波了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we won't need to do runs soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得给你找一套好点的连体工服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do have to find you a good pair of overalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去得像点样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to look the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴角上叼一株小麦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little piece of wheat out of the corner of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再长个农夫大臀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a bigger ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  委员会里其余的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, the rest of the council--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  格伦  卡萝尔  萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, Glenn, Carol, Sasha,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of them--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都想要我和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wanted me to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你出去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you go out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须得带上你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got to take your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是去围栏外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just outside the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带着我的刀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我遇到麻烦的话  六发子弹也没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get in trouble, six bullets isn't gonna make the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我们不想让你出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we want you to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.18,0:13:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你能帮我把这个带给我丈夫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can you please help me get this to my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经好几天没吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't eaten in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你  拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这附近有营地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a camp around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能不能跟你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we possibly come back with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}very badly on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要问他几个问题  问你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask him some questions, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就问三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:10.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上有枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a gun on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能确认一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I make sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm just gonna tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是跟我耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try anything--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,输的人会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna be the one who loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anything else to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:16:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克  看这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是维恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-尼克  -尼克  看这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nick. - Nick, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  尼克  -你们给它们起名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Nick. - You're naming them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个行尸有名牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one of them has a name tag,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就觉得它们都应该有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we thought all of them should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们活着的时候有名字  它们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had names when they were alive. They're dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  它们没死  只是不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not. They're just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能思考  它们吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't think. They eat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普通人也杀人  但他们还是有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}People kill people. They still have names.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们见过发生的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们见过有人那样死去的情景吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen someone die like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不是人  也不是宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not people and they're not pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别给它们起名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't name them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去看书  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to go read. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚参加故事会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming to story time tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时参加  我很幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go sometimes. I'm immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢的  是小孩的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't dig it. It's for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna head up there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿再聊  小长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch you later, young sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军队来后竖起了这些围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army came in and put these fences up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,建了一个避难基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made it a place for the people to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上周我们发现这个地方的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week when we spotted this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁丝网后面有很多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a bunch of walkers behind this chain-link
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像看门狗一样不让人进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping people out like a bunch of guard dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们都离开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they all just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give a listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把它们引走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drew 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天前放了一个录音机在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a boom box out there three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接在两块车用蓄电池上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooked it up to two car batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们来扫荡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's make a sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意安全  尽量多拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure it's safe. Grab what you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们带更多的人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll come back tomorrow with more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give it a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我觉得我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想知道达里尔以前是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to guess what Daryl did before the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经瞎猜了差不多六个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been trying to guess for, like, six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在慢慢猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm pacing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One shot a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:48.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在监狱里的行为方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the way you are at the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是委员会成员  你会追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you being on the council, you're able to track,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮助人们  但是你还是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're helping people, but you're still being kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阴沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}surly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big swing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是凶案警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homicide cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  相当说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这家伙说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, the man's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是卧底警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不会吧  真的吗  -真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, really? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢谈论这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to talk about it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为真的挺操蛋的  你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it was a lot of heavy shit, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  可别骗我  真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, come on, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来我得接着猜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll just keep guessing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  接着猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们要开始吗  探长  -干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna do this, Detective? - Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们进去  扫荡时保持队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we go in, stay in formation for the sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都知道该找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, you all know what you're supposed to look for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.43,0:20:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有没有没被你使唤过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there ever a time that you weren't the boss of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出生之前有那么几年吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a few years before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时准备去巴亚尔塔港度蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were going to Puerto Vallarta for our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们关闭了机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they shut down the airports,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的转接航班再也没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}our connecting flight never connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不许离开航站楼  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't let us leave the terminal, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就睡在\N{\fnArial\fs30}we slept next to these huge
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自津巴布韦的巨型大理石雕塑边\N{\fnArial\fs30}marble sculptures from Zimbabwe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第四天夜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, on the fourth night,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.52,0:22:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西就进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things just came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始我们有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a lot of us and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.44,0:22:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在只剩下埃迪和我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now it's just Eddie and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wouldn't have made it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本挺不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一次又一次地救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he saved me over and over again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者让我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that he showed me the things
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事不得不做  或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I had to do or...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该主动去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be willing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.09,0:22:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是因为他还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wasn't still here...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我也早就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just-- I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你指什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:22:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些你不得不主动去做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things you had to be willing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃我们能找到的任何食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eeating whatever we could find--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动物尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}animal carcasses
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,腐烂的水果  还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rotten fruit-- and...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抛弃其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving people behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲开那些需要援助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiding from people who needed my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:26.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是做慈善的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人必须集体行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to have numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是对抗行尸的最好武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are the best defense against walkers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者对抗其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.42,0:23:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.55,0:23:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管它们叫"行尸"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call them "Walkers"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  有受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? You cut or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.49,0:25:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但我的脚被压住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, but my foot is caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.66,0:25:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  他被压住了  来帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. He's just caught. Come on, help me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.53,0:25:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-出什么事了  -大家都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Everyone's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是被红酒和啤酒淹没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're over in wine and beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.37,0:25:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我动作可快了  伙计  直接冲向酒瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was moving fast, man. I drove right into the drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.55,0:26:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  是你运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you lucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.86,0:26:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西要是再偏一点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this thing had come down on you the wrong way...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.83,0:26:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, we should probably go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.03,0:26:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃还被压着  把他弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob's still stuck. Get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.76,0:26:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾在机场看过那些雕塑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw those sculptures at the airport once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢孩子玩跳背游戏的那尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite was the kids playing leapfrog.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:27:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.02,0:27:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪和我不得不做的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Eddie and I had to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也做过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you do things like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.86,0:27:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.73,0:27:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得做过那些事后  还能回到过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you get to come back from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.90,0:27:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.54,0:27:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.24,0:27:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们对你三个问题的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we answer your three questions
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让你们满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把鲍勃弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.62,0:29:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再挪一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}More, more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.69,0:29:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  必须得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  快走  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, now! Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.66,0:30:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.62,0:30:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.63,0:30:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.12,0:30:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.43,0:30:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地你还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.66,0:30:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.18,0:30:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.12,0:30:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想把野猪带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to take the boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.19,0:30:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我知道带你过来会更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just knew-- I knew I'd get you here so much quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.20,0:31:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他饿坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.58,0:31:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他越来越蔫  他需要吃活物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's slowing. He needs something alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.09,0:31:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你  我说过  我不能没有他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I told you, I can't be without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才留着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I kept him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.43,0:31:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.78,0:31:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And-- and you have to do things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.55,0:31:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我和他一样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要阻拦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.76,0:31:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在这之后杀掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't end it after.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -让我同他在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Let me be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.15,0:31:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.29,0:32:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.27,0:32:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}the questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.18,0:32:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那三个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.80,0:32:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀过多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many walkers have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.24,0:32:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.71,0:32:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪把它们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie killed-- killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.37,0:32:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.74,0:32:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀过多少活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.11,0:33:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.45,0:33:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.29,0:33:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.35,0:33:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.55,0:33:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't get to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.33,0:33:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事一旦发生  你就没法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.12,0:33:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}from things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.40,0:33:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回不去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.45,0:34:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"孩子们盯着蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children fastened their eyes upon their bit of candle
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.09,0:34:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着它缓缓地  无情地融化\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watched it melt slowly and pitilessly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后只剩半寸孤独的灯芯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the half inch of wick stand alone at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.59,0:34:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微弱的火苗忽上忽下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the feeble flame rise and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺着轻烟而上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb the thin tower of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.56,0:34:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,徘徊片刻  之后..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linger at its top a moment and then..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.64,0:34:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士  我该去放哨了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, should I take watch now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.34,0:34:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  卢克  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Luke, you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.14,0:34:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.94,0:34:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来学习刀具的用法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are talking about knives-- how to use them,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何安全地使用  如何用它们救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to be safe with them, and how they could save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.89,0:34:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士  我能先走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, may I be dismissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.81,0:35:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么  -我不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I'm not feeling very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时你要克服一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you're gonna have to fight through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.07,0:35:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一你独自在外怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you wind up out there alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不舒服就放弃自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just give up because you're feeling bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是不想吐在别人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just I don't want to yack on somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.85,0:35:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.69,0:35:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  今天我们学习如何握刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, today we're gonna learn how to hold a knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.79,0:35:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么砍刺  该瞄准哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to stab and slash and where to aim for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.28,0:35:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  不要告诉你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't tell your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.54,0:36:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.76,0:36:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想去外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like going out there, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.99,0:36:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔会告诉贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's telling Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.07,0:37:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是没办法的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.06,0:37:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.98,0:37:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你知道了吗  -知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.15,0:37:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.27,0:37:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没打算要孩子  但我们可以要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to, but we could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.31,0:37:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以在这里生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了洛莉和今天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you say that after today?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.23,0:37:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能还这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.57,0:37:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想害怕活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't want to be afraid of being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.20,0:37:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会害怕才让我们活到了今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being afraid is what's kept us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.35,0:37:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这只是苟延残喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how we kept breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.54,0:37:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-嗨  -嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Hey.  -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.26,0:38:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扎克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.11,0:38:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.97,0:38:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.90,0:38:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.40,0:38:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.24,0:38:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.14,0:38:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.26,0:38:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't cry anymore, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.78,0:38:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得很高兴认识了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad I got to know him, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.97,0:38:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.87,0:39:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是厌倦了同伴的离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tired of losing people is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.99,0:39:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很庆幸没有跟他道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I didn't say good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate good-byes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.63,0:39:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(梅肯)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.51,0:39:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试图帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.30,0:39:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮不了  没人帮得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't. No one could.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人已经病入膏肓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.74,0:39:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.58,0:39:53.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试图帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.92,0:39:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}How that woman wound up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.42,0:39:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也差点成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got close to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.58,0:40:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我失去了卡尔和朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I lost Carl and Judith,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.47,0:40:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I lost this place--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.63,0:40:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的  瑞克  即使那样也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not then, Rick. Not even then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.71,0:40:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.38,0:40:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的儿子回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.66,0:40:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定不会迷失\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to come back. You do.
